WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,750
There are two cars in total

2
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:01,720
Move it for me before noon

3
00:00:01,720 --> 00:00:02,920
We can't park cars here for too long.

4
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:03,920
Otherwise the market management will say

5
00:00:03,920 --> 00:00:04,840
Be careful for me

6
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:08,880
My furniture is not cheap anymore. Don’t break it and it will become cruelty. I will have to deduct the money. Don’t worry.

7
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:10,520
We both do things very carefully

8
00:00:10,520 --> 00:00:16,480
I will never break anything for you. Come on, come on, put it here for me to clean up.

9
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:25,480
Okay, it's only noon and you can finish moving it here for me.

10
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:26,560
This is today's wages

11
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:27,520
Thank you, Boss Lin

12
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:28,440
Please leave your phone number

13
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:30,320
If we have any luck here from now on, we'll come to you.

14
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:31,240
Your physical fitness

15
00:00:31,240 --> 00:00:32,560
It’s really not something ordinary people can do.

16
00:00:32,680 --> 00:00:33,640
And the food is better too

17
00:00:33,640 --> 00:00:36,840
It's also faster. Boss Lin, just use mine. You have my phone number.

18
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:38,880
If you need anything in the future, just come to me. Brother Xiao doesn’t have a number.

19
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:41,760
We both go out to do things and eat together, right?

20
00:00:42,740 --> 00:00:43,660
two brothers

21
00:00:43,660 --> 00:00:45,820
I just saw you guys moving furniture over there, they were really good at it.

22
00:00:45,820 --> 00:00:47,300
My brother also has things to move over there.

23
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:50,780
Come and help me move after dinner, boss lady, what are you moving?

24
00:00:50,780 --> 00:00:52,060
My brother has a shop over there

25
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:53,580
Doing various small businesses

26
00:00:53,580 --> 00:00:54,660
If you can still work

27
00:00:54,660 --> 00:00:56,180
Now go help my brother move things

28
00:00:56,180 --> 00:00:57,220
The wages are the same as mine here

29
00:00:57,220 --> 00:01:00,460
If we finish moving, can we do it for three hundred yuan? That's fine.

30
00:01:00,460 --> 00:01:01,460
Let me take you there
